'''Reaver''' is an [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Reaver Gamepass]] for 1,699 robux during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. When purchased, it initially starts as a rare knife, but as the player gains XP [[File:XP Symbol.png|25px|link=XP]], it evolves into a knife of a higher rarity. Once purchased, it cannot be traded to other users.

== Item Description ==
As shown on the pass the description is, " A BRAND NEW type of knife! This knife EVOLVES as you use it! It starts as a RARE, earn XP with it equipped to level it up to Legendary, Godly, and finally, ANCIENT. This knife will only be available for a limited time, and is NOT TRADABLE. "

== Appearance ==
=== Variant 1 ===
The first variant of the knife follows the [[Default Knife]] mesh. Its blade is a dark purple color, with a brighter gradient-like edge. The blade also consists of green cracks. The guard matches the blade, and the handle is a darker purple. It is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] at the [[Knives|knife's]] first stage.

=== Variant 2 ===
The second variant of this knife is quite similar to the previous stage, but the handle and guard has a lighter shimmer on it and the blade is cleaner. It is now a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]]. 

=== Variant 3 === 
The third variant of the knife turns into a [[Godly Weapons|godly]], with a different mesh. It has a long gray blade with a jagged green edge with three stone vines entwined around the blade. It has an additional blade attached to the guard, and has a purple paracord handle, along with a sharp arrowhead attached to the bottom.

=== Variant 4 ===
The fourth and final variant of the [[Knives|knife]] is where it turns into an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]]. It appears to be a double-bladed symmetrical scythe with a long, thin black handle with green arrowheads at the ends. Both blades are stone gray with small green lines and sharp ends, along with a jagged green edge. These blades are entwined in three stone vines, and both have an additional small blade attached to the handle called a poll, with another stone vine tied around it.

== Trivia ==
* This, [[Gingerscythe]], [[Icecrusher]], and [[Synthwave]] are the only gamepass knives to be untradeable.
* It requires 864,000 XP [[File:XP Symbol.png|25px|link=XP]] to get the knife to [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]].
* This, [[Gingerscythe]], [[Icecrusher]], and [[Synthwave]] are also the only [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] weapons in Murder Mystery 2.
* It has a partner gun under the name [[Harvester]].
* This is one of the few scythes in game, the others being [[Nik's Scythe]], [[Batwing]], [[Icewing]], [[Elderwood Scythe]], [[Hallowscythe]]. [[Gingerscythe]], and [[Synthwave]].
*All the variants were designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*This is currently the only [[Evo Weapons|Evo]] in the game to not have leaderboard variants. 

